{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2022-08-09 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT ENABLES XIAOMI TO ACCELERATE 5G RELEASE 16 DEVICE VALIDATION', 'text': "SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #3GPP--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS), A LEADING TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT DELIVERS ADVANCED DESIGN AND VALIDATION SOLUTIONS TO HELP ACCELERATE INNOVATION TO CONNECT AND SECURE THE WORLD, ANNOUNCED THAT XIAOMI HAS SELECTED KEYSIGHT'S 5G DEVICE TEST SOLUTIONS TO ACCELERATE 5G RELEASE 16 (REL-16) DEVICE VALIDATION IN SUPPORT OF THE LATEST 3GPP 5G NEW RADIO (NR) FEATURES AND SPECIFICATIONS. XIAOMI, THE WORLD'S THIRD LARGEST SMARTPHONE VENDOR MEASURED BY GLOBAL"}